  "details": "Description\n\nwhenever I use a photo as icon in my profile, it works fine until i close the game and open it again. The profile picture icon image does not save between sessions, yet the cropped icon stays saved in my gallery. Please fix this so i don't have to keep changing it and saving it everytime i re open the game.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nNot closing the game\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-15_22-31-30.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_fe69256e-d864-4b7d-9843-5737ea854804/1/file)",
